{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoAssembly","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.BraidGroup","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.QuantumTrace"],"declarations":33,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.braidTrace_eq_kz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.braidTrace_eq_kz","kind":"theorem","line":412,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L412-L425","doc":"**The mass identity on the KZ side.** The normalised Markov trace of a braid `β`\n(`braidTrace`, the left side of `MassTraceMarkov.braidTrace_wordBraid`) is the site-weighted\ntrace of the continuous KZ holonomy representation on `β`'s image in `H_{m+1}(q)`:\n`tr_M(β) = wi^{m+1} · Tr(K^{⊗(m+1)} · KZ(x_β))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.siteWeight_trace_kz_eq_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.siteWeight_trace_kz_eq_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L403-L409","doc":"**The site-weighted trace of the KZ holonomy is that of Jimbo's R-matrix action.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.siteWeight_eq_diag_cnt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.siteWeight_eq_diag_cnt","kind":"theorem","line":395,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L395-L401","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.prod_weight_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.prod_weight_eq","kind":"theorem","line":374,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L374-L393","doc":"The site weight `K^{⊗N}`, `K = diag(w₀, w₁)`, acts by `w₀^{N−k} w₁^k` on `V_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.weighted_trace_kz_eq_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.weighted_trace_kz_eq_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":362,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L362-L370","doc":"**The weighted-trace identity.** For every complex coupling `κ` with `q = e^{2πiκ}` not a\nroot of unity, every `h ∈ H_{m+1}(q)` and every operator `D` acting by a scalar `f(k)` on each\nweight space, `Tr(D · KZ(h)) = Tr(D · Jimbo(h))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_res_kz_eq_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_res_kz_eq_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L345-L360","doc":"**On each weight space the KZ and Jimbo representations have the same trace**, at every\ncomplex coupling with `q` not a root of unity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_jimboRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_jimboRep","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L341-L343","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_kzHeckeC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_kzHeckeC","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L336-L339","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_kzBraidRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_kzBraidRep","kind":"theorem","line":327,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L327-L334","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.conj_of_eq_at_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.conj_of_eq_at_zero","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L281-L315","doc":"Two families of representations of `H_{n+1}(q(κ))` on `ℂ^M`, with generator matrices\ncontinuous in `κ` and equal at `κ = 0`, are conjugate at every `κ` with `q(κ)` not a root of\nunity. (The argument of `kz_conj_jimbo_complex`, for arbitrary families.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_eq_of_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_eq_of_conj","kind":"theorem","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L267-L271","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_diag_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.trace_diag_mul","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L250-L263","doc":"**Weighted traces split over weight spaces.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.continuous_res","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.continuous_res","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L245-L248","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.resHom_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.resHom_apply","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L241-L243","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.resHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.resHom","kind":"def","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L226-L239","doc":"The restriction to `V_k` of a weight-preserving representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.res_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.res_mul","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L216-L224","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.res","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.res","kind":"def","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L212-L214","doc":"Restriction of a matrix to `V_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.Wt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.Wt","kind":"def","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L209-L210","doc":"The weight-`k` basis vectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_strandBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_strandBraid","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L195-L199","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_permRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_permRep","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L189-L193","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_of_commute_wproj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP_of_commute_wproj","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L182-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_wproj_of_WP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_wproj_of_WP","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L173-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.wproj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.wproj","kind":"def","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L169-L171","doc":"The projector onto the weight-`k` subspace `V_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.wpSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.wpSub","kind":"def","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L150-L167","doc":"The weight-preserving matrices form a subalgebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.WP","kind":"def","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L146-L148","doc":"`X` preserves total weight: its entries vanish between basis vectors of different weight. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L126-L144","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_comp_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_comp_perm","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L123-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt_le","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L117-L121","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.cnt","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L114-L115","doc":"The total weight of a basis vector: the number of sites in state `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.hecke_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.hecke_mem","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L94-L106","doc":"Everything in the image of a map out of `H_m(q)` lies in any subalgebra containing the\ngenerator images. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_kzBraidRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_kzBraidRep","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L75-L90","doc":"**KZ equivariance.** Anything commuting with `ρ(S_{m+1})` commutes with the whole KZ\nholonomy representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_genFund","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_genFund","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L55-L73","doc":"Anything commuting with the permutation action commutes with every KZ transport: both\n`Z U(t)` and `U(t) Z` solve the transport equation with initial value `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_kzForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted.commute_kzForm","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeighted.lean#L46-L51","signatureChunk":0}]}